m":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T02:03:14-07:00","id":1516073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>werewolf43</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516070#post1516070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who drawed those?</div> </div> </div> </div>Someone who:<br /> A, can't draw (and can't even properly plagiaris or copy)<br /> B, hate Werewolf: the Apocalypse with burning passion<br /> C, don't know or don't care about the subject suposed to be depicted in the art<br /> D, any combination of A, B and/or C<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T02:14:59-07:00","id":1516074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516073#post1516073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Someone who:<br /> A, can't draw (and can't even properly plagiaris or copy)<br /> B, hate Werewolf: the Apocalypse with burning passion<br /> C, don't know or don't care about the subject suposed to be depicted in the art<br /> D, any combination of A, B and/or C<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>We've seen past work of this artist and he can draw. But I think the two issues at play here are the quantity of art he was supposed to deliver (he has art in <i>every </i>WOD5E book that has come out this year so far) and the convoluted development of the second iteration of W5 left him with little time to not just trace photos in order to save time.<br /> <br /> ________________________________________________<br /> <br /> By the way, I found one of the photos he traced. It's from a <a href=\"https://hypebeast.com/2012/9/acronym-2012-fall-winter-collection\" target=\"_blank\">German fashion-brand called Acronym</a> and not a stock-photo. Man, one of these days this is gonna create problems for both the artist and this book...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T02:30:06-07:00","id":1516077,"title":"","content":"Aside from the copying the art style of w5 is incredably bland. V5 had this issue even when it was competently executed. If you look at most of these guys nothing really stands out or pops they just look like a bunch of generic npcs.<br /> <br /> <br /> their also seems to be a deep aversion to showing werewolves as werewolves in the art.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 06-25-2023, 05:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T02:32:33-07:00","id":1516078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516077#post1516077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aside from the copying the art style of w5 is incredably bland. V5 had this issue even when it was competently executed. If you look at most of these guys nothing really stands out or pops they just look like a bunch of generic npcs.</div> </div> </div> </div>And I think those two things are related. If you're limited to mostly just tracing photos you found on the internet, then of course it's quite hard to develop some sort of coherent artistic vision for a project.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T03:04:59-07:00","id":1516081,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516077#post1516077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aside from the copying the art style of w5 is incredably bland. V5 had this issue even when it was competently executed. If you look at most of these guys nothing really stands out or pops they just look like a bunch of generic npcs.<br /> <br /> <br /> their also seems to be a deep aversion to showing werewolves as werewolves in the art.</div> </div> </div> </div>... and then you have the pieces by WolfSkullJack, but even she said that they got only 3 for the whole book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T03:45:44-07:00","id":1516085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516078#post1516078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And I think those two things are related. If you're limited to mostly just tracing photos you found on the internet, then of course it's quite hard to develop some sort of coherent artistic vision for a project.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, its going to be an absolute pain trying to do distinctive crinos. If you look at w20 most wolf forms are quite distinct for example if you compare the get to the fianna. If you're relying on generic werewolf pics for crinos then you're going to have a hard time.<br /> <br /> The rushed nature nature art really doesn't bode well for the game itself. For example outstars surprise people didn't use crinos implies a lack of playtesting and forethought into mechanical design.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T05:03:41-07:00","id":1516091,"title":"","content":"What, in the name of Gaia, is this guy?<br /> <img title=\"image.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1246_1687694568520_911\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1246\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1246\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1246&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10047-vis\u00e3o-de-\u00e1guia","name":"Vis\u00e3o-de-\u00c1guia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10047_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T07:44:27-07:00","id":1516099,"title":"","content":"Considering the sheer number of just straight-up traced photos we've gotten here, I think it's safe to assume that it isn't just the artist but that the art-director must be in on this. There's no way this artist could've gotten away with this many traced photos for his artwork without the art-director noticing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T07:49:39-07:00","id":1516100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516099#post1516099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering the sheer number of just straight-up traced photos we've gotten here, I think it's safe to assume that it isn't just the artist but that the art-director must be in on this. There's no way this artist could've gotten away with this many traced photos for his artwork without the art-director noticing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Assuming there was/is an Art Director and it wasn't just JA or KM juggling all responsibilities. The current WoD team is pretty small and mainly composed of ' Community' folks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T07:58:10-07:00","id":1516102,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516100#post1516100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Assuming there was/is an Art Director and it wasn't just JA or KM juggling all responsibilities. The current WoD team is pretty small and mainly composed of ' Community' folks.</div> </div> </div> </div>They do have an art director, Tomas Arfert.<br /> <br /> The mangy wolf worries me, because if it is a Bone Gnawer like I expect, then they are still going with the 'omega wolf' concept. If it, on the other hand, is a Red Talon, then it is saying the wolf born have it so bad that they end up with mange.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T08:00:42-07:00","id":1516103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516100#post1516100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Assuming there was/is an Art Director and it wasn't just JA or KM juggling all responsibilities. The current WoD team is pretty small and mainly composed of ' Community' folks.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, there definitely is one. It's Tomas Arfert and he's also the &quot;Brand Art Director&quot;. But who knows what was exactly was going on behind the scenes. The thing is, though, that you have an art-director to prevent this. Legalities aside, I don't think it makes the artist look good when the process is just &quot;take a photo, flip it, trace it - and then give the guy a hood.&quot;. At the same time, it's clear that they asked this one artist to do 44 of these photo-realistic drawings in his style. And who knows how little time he had for this - considering that the writing-process wasn't even finished last October...<br /> <br /> And the writing-process wasn't finished even though they were using text from the first iteration of W5 as inspiration and to just copy-paste stuff (like a new Tribe name for the Elder Brother Tribe).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T08:14:12-07:00","id":1516105,"title":"","content":"I guess that thin wolf is some miserable BSD heavily irradiated but still alive cause of garou regeneration. Nothing else have any sense, or victim of brutal brawl (hardly).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T12:54:52-07:00","id":1516124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516103#post1516103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, there definitely is one. It's Tomas Arfert and he's also the &quot;Brand Art Director&quot;. But who knows what was exactly was going on behind the scenes. The thing is, though, that you have an art-director to prevent this. Legalities aside, I don't think it makes the artist look good when the process is just &quot;take a photo, flip it, trace it - and then give the guy a hood.&quot;. At the same time, it's clear that they asked this one artist to do 44 of these photo-realistic drawings in his style. And who knows how little time he had for this - considering that the writing-process wasn't even finished last October...<br /> <br /> And the writing-process wasn't finished even though they were using text from the first iteration of W5 as inspiration and to just copy-paste stuff (like a new Tribe name for the Elder Brother Tribe).</div> </div> </div> </div>From talking to a few different groups of playtesters it looks like minimal changes were made after playtrsting and feedback was essentially ignored as well....<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T12:56:08-07:00","id":1516125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>werewolf43</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516105#post1516105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I guess that thin wolf is some miserable BSD heavily irradiated but still alive cause of garou regeneration. Nothing else have any sense, or victim of brutal brawl (hardly).</div> </div> </div> </div>Well....its in lupus form so therefore no regeneration active....unless supernatural mange is a major threat now....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T15:28:44-07:00","id":1516134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516077#post1516077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aside from the copying the art style of w5 is incredably bland. V5 had this issue even when it was competently executed. If you look at most of these guys nothing really stands out or pops they just look like a bunch of generic npcs.<br /> <br /> <br /> their also seems to be a deep aversion to showing werewolves as werewolves in the art.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe it was some instruction they received, as the Crinos will be very limited they don't want to put too much of it to distort the tone they want, or the guy was too lazy or in a hurry so he just put pictures of regular people and put two or three in other ways to be a faster service.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T15:39:34-07:00","id":1516139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516065#post1516065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It isn't even a zombie wolf, it is a wolf with mange. In fact, I can EASILY trace the origins of it;<br /> <br /> <img width=\"250\" height=\"141\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HmkfKvA.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/HmkfKvA.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/HmkfKvA.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> From <a href=\"https://www.princeton.edu/news/2021/01/25/mange-yellowstone-wolves-reveals-insights-human-scabies-and-conservation-biology\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a> And I don't think I need to note that these images are not stock images.</div> </div> </div> </div>Worse, I remember that urban Gangrel tend to turn into wolves with mange, is his head in a vampire or did he literally take the first image he found on google to use as a reference, by the way, do the drawings need to be realistic? I liked the drawings of the third edition, although it was a little strange in parts. Also someone knows if WtF was a good sell?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T16:35:09-07:00","id":1516147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516102#post1516102\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u2026 The mangy wolf worries me, because if it is a Bone Gnawer like I expect, then they are still going with the 'omega wolf' concept. If it, on the other hand, is a Red Talon, then it is saying the wolf born have it so bad that they end up with mange.</div> </div> </div> </div>Based on the French crowd funding (could be the Spanish one) the wolves are Red Talons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-26T01:17:19-07:00","id":1516186,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516102#post1516102\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The mangy wolf worries me, because if it is a Bone Gnawer like I expect, then they are still going with the 'omega wolf' concept. If it, on the other hand, is a Red Talon, then it is saying the wolf born have it so bad that they end up with mange.</div> </div> </div> </div>It would certainly say something if the only wolf-born Garou in the Tribe-section end up being wolves with mange...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516124#post1516124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From talking to a few different groups of playtesters it looks like minimal changes were made after playtrsting and feedback was essentially ignored as well....</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> Hopefully, this doesn't mean they're gonna take shortcuts like in H5 with the Danger-track where they just listed a bunch of examples and shrugged saying &quot;You go figure out the rest, Storyteller...&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-26T01:17:57-07:00","id":1516187,"title":"","content":"That doesn't make sense to me. Red Talons should have one of the most glorious lupus form out there while their Homid form might look like homeless Tarzan.<br /> Not this diseased and wounded-looking dog.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-26T03:17:25-07:00","id":1516191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516147#post1516147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Based on the French crowd funding (could be the Spanish one) the wolves are Red Talons.</div> </div> </div> </div>How is it shown?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-26T03:38:16-07:00","id":1516194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Technoma</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516187#post1516187\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That doesn't make sense to me. Red Talons should have one of the most glorious lupus form out there while their Homid form might look like homeless Tarzan.<br /> Not this diseased and wounded-looking dog.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tell me about it, first I thought that is a Black Spiral Dancer who is featured as &quot;deterrent example\u200b&quot;<br /> If that is really a Talon?<br /> Yikes<br /> Big yikes<br /> ...or they went with the Apocalypse route and the Red Talons finally gave in, and basically went Wyrm, just nobody noticed yet, because the Garou Nation never gave a shit what happens with the Red Talons (or Wendigo, or Bone Gnawlers, or...). <br /> Sit! Behave! Be quiet! Get off the coutch! For fucks sake, wear some clothes! Bath! Use the silverware and close your mouth while chewing! Learn to talk like a Human! Hold your Rage! Don't bite (or eat) the Humans! You are under the Homids, silly, simple minded wolf...<br /> Maybe they had enough... <br /> Or some Wyrmish plague ran rampant and offed the wolf population, and the more resilient wolf-born survivors are on the brink of insanity and extiction (more than usual), diseased, wounded, mange all over... just a few minutes away before Old Wolf of the Woods finally dies, and the Talons rip everything to shreads - Ravnos style after the Week of Nightmares - like rabid beast before their &quot;friends&quot; put them out of their miseries...<br /> <br /> With such a scenario I would understand such a look how the art depcited that poor wolf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-26T04:39:33-07:00","id":1516197,"title":"","content":"I'd hazard a guess that there's no meaning to the mange other than trying to look edgy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-26T05:39:29-07:00","id":1516201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516194#post1516194\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Tell me about it, first I thought that is a Black Spiral Dancer who is featured as &quot;deterrent example\u200b&quot;<br /> If that is really a Talon?<br /> Yikes<br /> Big yikes<br /> ...or they went with the Apocalypse route and the Red Talons finally gave in, and basically went Wyrm, just nobody noticed yet, because the Garou Nation never gave a shit what happens with the Red Talons (or Wendigo, or Bone Gnawlers, or...).<br /> Sit! Behave! Be quiet! Get off the coutch! For fucks sake, wear some clothes! Bath! Use the silverware and close your mouth while chewing! Learn to talk like a Human! Hold your Rage! Don't bite (or eat) the Humans! You are under the Homids, silly, simple minded wolf...<br /> Maybe they had enough...<br /> Or some Wyrmish plague ran rampant and offed the wolf population, and the more resilient wolf-born survivors are on the brink of insanity and extiction (more than usual), diseased, wounded, mange all over... just a few minutes away before Old Wolf of the Woods finally dies, and the Talons rip everything to shreads - Ravnos style after the Week of Nightmares - like rabid beast before their &quot;friends&quot; put them out of their miseries...<br /> <br /> With such a scenario I would understand such a look how the art depcited that poor wolf</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the thing is that Talons are not a fallen tribe in W5. They seem to be getting by just as well as GWs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-26T05:59:18-07:00","id":1516203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1515745-w5-loresheets?p=1516191#post1516191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How is it shown?</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the stretch goals is a Tribe supplement of some sort (I don\u2019t read French to know the specifics) and the sample image is those two wolves and the humans next to them in the picture with the words Griffes R